<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS NET SELLERS OF S.AFRICA BONDS LAST WEEK.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS NET SELLERS OF S.AFRICA BONDS LAST WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers</p>
<p>of 70.73 million rand worth of South African bonds last week,</p>
<p>latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				 Week to Sept 27   Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		     2,742.71     123,672.37</p>
<p>    - sales			   2,813.44     121,540.33</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)	 (70.73)	2,132.04</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
